          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "foreman of half the portion assigned to",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Beth-zur, repaired to a point opposite the sepulchres of David, to the artificial pool, and to the house of the mighty men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After him the Levites repaired: Rehum the son of Bani; next to him Hashabiah, ruler of half the district of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
