          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After him Baruch the son of Zabbai repaired another section from the Angle to the door of the house of Eliashib the high priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
