              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and to the corner. Palal the son of Uzai repaired opposite the Angle and the tower projecting from the upper house of the king at the court of the guard. After him Pedaiah the son of Parosh ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
